msgid "PAGE_FAQ_Q_WHY_EXIST"
msgstr "Why does this website exist/"

#: templates/help_center.html:120
msgid "PAGE_FAQ_A_WHY_EXIST_PART1"
msgstr ""
"Good question. It all began when one of our team members wanted to upload a "
"3D Windows XP screensaver on a certain old software website that wasn't "
"quite popular and was barely saved on the Internet Archive."

#: templates/help_center.html:121
msgid "PAGE_FAQ_A_WHY_EXIST_PART2"
msgstr ""
"In a few days the screensaver was deleted from the website, stating that "
"\"It's not suitable for the website's topic\". When he questioned \"Why do "
"you have Windows XP disk images on your website then?\", staff members "
"couldn't give a straight answer."

#: templates/help_center.html:122
msgid "PAGE_FAQ_A_WHY_EXIST_PART3"
msgstr ""
"Nothing to worry about, we are not saddened and we won't be competitors to "
"them, we just wanted to create our own little catalog :3"

